{"name":"Kauzy Andreje Babiše | Nasdílej, než to zakážou","short_name":"Kauzy Babiše","description":"Všechny kauzy Andreje Babiše chronologicky: od členství v KSČ a evidence u StB přes Petrimex, Agrofert a Čapí hnízdo až po střet zájmů. U každého tvrzení je zdroj.","lang":"cs","start_url":"/","background_color":"#fff","theme_color":"#000","display":"standalone","icons":[{"src":"icons/icon-48x48.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"48x48","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-72x72.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"72x72","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-96x96.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"96x96","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-144x144.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"144x144","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-192x192.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"192x192","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-256x256.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"256x256","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-384x384.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"384x384","type":"image/png"},{"src":"icons/icon-512x512.png?v=3f9e9c32bc970ffd80abc74e69ba1a1d","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png"}]}